*Behaviour & rules:*
# Defaults (exact):
** {{LedPowerConfig.Default}} = (16, 20, 17, Nm405, 0.1, 10, 60, { Nm450: (true,false,false,false, LedFanPwm 30), Nm405: (true,true,false,true, null) }).
