```
*Behaviour & rules:*
# Identity: Source "simulation", IsSimulated true, DriverFault always null, ActiveMode starts at {{led_power.default_mode}}; chamber starts at 24.0; {{_lineBar}} = 2.0; BOFA presence null; damper / driver null until driven.
# {{Tick()}} (called lazily by reads and writes, under lock): dt = clamp(now - last, 0, 10 s); last = now. Heater on -> chamber = min(95, chamber + 0.5*dt). Else if FAN_COOLING duty > 0 and damper open -> rate/min = duty>=100 ? 5.0 : duty>=60 ? 2.5 : 1.0; chamber = max(24, chamber - rate/60*dt). Else idle drift 0.05 deg/s toward 24 (clamped at ambient from either side). LED warm-up per panel (LEFT->TEMP_LEFT, RIGHT->TEMP_RIGHT, BACK->TEMP_BACK, DOOR->TEMP_DOOR): lit at pct -> extra += 0.02*(pct/10)*dt; unlit -> extra = max(0, extra - 0.02*dt).
# {{ReadTemperature(s)}} = null if forced open, else chamber + offset[s] + ledExtra[s] with offsets LEFT 1.5, RIGHT 2.0, DOOR 0.5, BACK 1.0, CHAMBER 0.0 (no chamber calibration, no glitch hold). {{ReadTemperatureVolts}}: null -> 3.3; else R = 10000*exp(3934*(1/(t+273.15) - 1/298.15)); V = 3.3*R/(10000+R).
# {{ReadUvSensorVolts(s)}} = 2.8 - (2.8-0.6)*clamp(level(panel)/10, 0, 1).
# Fans: {{SetFanDuty}} clamps 0..100. RPM model: forced failure value if set; duty 0 -> 0; points = damper open and {{fan_health.nominal_rpm_damper_open}} has the fan ? those : {{nominal_rpm[fan]}}; rpm = round({{FanHealthEvaluator.ExpectedRpm(points, duty)}} ?? 2850*duty/100). {{ReadRpm}} returns null on the FIRST call per fan, then the model value; {{MeasureRpm}} returns the model value immediately (no wait).
# {{ReadPressure()}}: sensor missing -> {{(0.0, -0.25, -2.5, false, false, "analog_voltage", set_point)}}. bar = valve open and not blocked and lineBar set ? round(lineBar*0.3, 3) : lineBar. bar null -> {{(0.0, null, null, false, false, "switch", set_point)}}. Else mpa = bar/10; volts = round((v_min + (mpa - p_at_v_min)*(v_max-v_min)/(p_at_v_max - p_at_v_min)) / divider, 3); On = mpa >= set_point; Saturated false; Mode "analog_voltage".
# {{DoorOpen()}}: forced value if set; else true while within 5 s after {{SetDoorMagnet(true)}} (then the timer clears); else false. {{SetDoorMagnet(false)}} does nothing.
# LEDs: same rules as HW-12 rule 3 a/b (mode inference when null, door refusal with "Door is Open - Operation Disabled", wavelength refusal "{led} not allowed in {mode} mode", unknown LED refusal); on -> LedPowerApplied = true; level = on ? pct : 0; LED fan duty = on ? {{LedFanSpeed(cfg, mode)}} : 0; last LED off -> LedPowerApplied false. {{AllLedsOff}} zeroes every LED and its fan, LedPowerApplied false. {{SelectMode(w)}} = AllLedsOff + mode = w (never refused). {{LedPowerOff}} -> LedPowerApplied false. {{AllowedLeds}} as real board.
# Actuators: nitrogen, light, heater flags stored; {{SetBofaDuty}} clamps 0..100 and Bofa = duty>0; {{SetBofa(on)}} = duty 100/0; {{GetBofaDuty}} returns the requested percent; BOFA power flag; {{BofaPresent}} returns the simulated value (default null - "cannot tell", so no 9048 in simulation). {{SetDamper(open)}} ticks, stores open, DamperDriver = "pio". {{NfcReset}} no-op. {{RgbFill}} length != {{rgb.count}} -> {{ArgumentException}}; stores a copy in {{LastRgbFrame}}; {{RgbOff}} stores an all-zero frame of {{rgb.count}}.
# {{StartupSafe()}} / {{AllSafe()}}: all fan duties 0, heater, nitrogen, BOFA (on, duty, power), light off, LEDs cleared, mode = default. Damper, door magnet, forced faults unchanged. {{Dispose}} no-op.
*Configuration:* {{led_power}}, {{leds}}, {{fan_health.nominal_rpm}} / {{nominal_rpm_damper_open}}, {{pressure_sensor}} (v_min, v_max, p_at_v_min_mpa, p_at_v_max_mpa, divider, set_point_mpa), {{rgb.count}}.
*Acceptance criteria:*
* Identity: pressure (1.8, 0.2, 2.0, true, false, "analog_voltage", 0.1); door closed; chamber 24.0.
* Heater on +10 s -> 29.0; +60 s in one tick -> 34.0 (dt clamped to 10 s); from 94 +10 s -> 95.0.
* Damper open + FAN_COOLING 100/60/30 from 60 deg over 60 s (6 ticks of 10 s) -> 55.0 / 57.5 / 59.0.
* Damper closed + fan 100 from 30 over 10 s -> 29.5; from 20 -> 20.5; long idle clamps at 24.0.
* 450 nm LED_DOOR 60 -> FAN_DOOR 30; 405 nm -> 100.
* At 24 deg: LEFT 25.5, RIGHT 26.0, DOOR 24.5, BACK 25.0; UV dark 2.8; LEFT 50 -> UV_LEFT 0.6, UV_RIGHT 2.8, FAN_LEFT 100; +10 s -> TEMP_LEFT 25.5 + 0.02*5*10.
* RPM: first ReadRpm(FAN_HEATER) null, then 0; duty 100 -> 5925; duty 50 -> 3669; forced 0 -> 0; cleared -> 3669.
* Magnet: door open until 4.9 s, closed at 5.1 s; LED refused while open. Below-min LED -> level 0; 450 nm LEFT refused; DOOR lit -> LedPowerApplied; AllLedsOff -> false.
* Open sensor -> null and 3.3 V; at 25 deg -> 1.65 V.
* Line 3.5 bar -> Mpa 0.35, Volts 2.4; null -> Bar null; valve open -> 0.6 bar; blocked -> 2.0; sensor missing -> 0.0 V.
* Damper false -> DamperOpen false, driver "pio"; RgbFill 21 ok, 2 colours -> ArgumentException; StartupSafe resets nitrogen, BOFA, heater.
*Tests:* {{SimulatedHardwareSystemTests}} (Identity_and_fixed_values, Heater_raises_half_a_degree_per_second_up_to_95_with_dt_clamped, Cooling_fan_with_open_damper_cools_per_minute_by_mode_duty theory, Cooling_needs_the_damper_open_and_idle_drifts_back_to_ambient, Led_fan_runs_at_30_percent_in_450nm_and_at_full_speed_in_405nm, Led_panels_warm_their_thermistors_while_lit, Fan_rpm_follows_duty_and_failures_can_be_injected, Door_magnet_opens_the_door_for_five_seconds_and_gating_matches_the_real_board, Open_sensor_reads_null_and_rail_volts, Line_pressure_can_be_set_for_the_n2_interlock_tests, The_n2_sensor_always_reads_unless_a_test_unplugs_it, Line_pressure_drops_while_the_valve_is_open_unless_the_flow_is_blocked, Actuators_and_rgb), using FakeTimeProvider and the shipped components.json.
*Reference (source):* {{src/SCureBox.Hardware/SimulatedHardwareSystem.cs}}, {{tests/SCureBox.Hardware.Tests/SimulatedHardwareSystemTests.cs}}

